#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/histogram.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.histogram.histogram:70
msgid ""
"Set color or pattern for filling bars [Default is no fill]. Set it to one of "
"the two special values to fill bars by looking up the color from a CPT "
"instead of a constant color:  - ``\"position\"``: look up the color using "
"the mid-coordinate of the bin. This is   the default when ``cmap`` is set. - "
"``\"value\"``: look up the color using the bin value, i.e., the bar count "
"or   frequency.  The special values require a CPT (either the current CPT or "
"explicitly set by ``cmap``), and can't be used with ``fill``."
msgstr ""

