"interest."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/histogram.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.histogram.histogram:155
msgid ""
"Set frame and axes attributes for the plot. It can be a bool, ``\"none\"``, "
"a :class:`pygmt.params.Frame` or :class:`pygmt.params.Axis` object. Raw GMT "
"strings or sequences of strings are also supported for backward "
"compatibility. If ``frame=True``, the frame will be drawn with the default "
"attributes. If ``frame=\"none\"``, no frame will be drawn. Use "
"a :class:`pygmt.params.Frame` or :class:`pygmt.params.Axis` object for more "
"control over the attributes of the frame and axes. A tutorial is available "
"at :doc:`frame and axes attributes </tutorials/basics/frames>`. Full "
"documentation is at :gmt-docs:`gmt.html#b-full`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/histogram.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.histogram.histogram:164
